{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrowflight Station - a remote research facility in the depths of a sea of fog, built in the shadow of a massive exoskeleton. Only five crew members remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/01d685dc87c43135c3bcb31eaa8729d6.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were supposed to be evacuated weeks ago. Now your sanity and your supplies are running out, as a violent fog storm has cut off any contact to the outside world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate a dwindling crew from a ramshackle comms room in order to survive, and choose what to prioritize in the face of complete disaster: your escape - or the scientific breakthrough you've been chasing your entire life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remote puzzle investigation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a radio operator. Gather clues and solve puzzles by interpreting research data and surveillance footage.  Get claustrophobic in the confines of a tiny comms room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/dba6aa5b17844833afd79ce109848184.poster.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/dba6aa5b17844833afd79ce109848184.webm?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/dba6aa5b17844833afd79ce109848184.mp4?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clarity as a resource</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make do with severely limited bandwidth. Decide what data you want to clear up, and what secrets will remain unresolved.\u00a0Remotely guide your driver through dangerous terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/fb3c2eb55a62cfdd0831f3d15e13cf9c.poster.avif?t=1761902494\" width=900 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/fb3c2eb55a62cfdd0831f3d15e13cf9c.webm?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/fb3c2eb55a62cfdd0831f3d15e13cf9c.mp4?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A myriad of mysteries to uncover</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inhabit a remote outpost built in an uncanny, foggy wasteland. Find out what\u2019s behind the giant exoskeleton you are researching. Figure out what your crewmates are hiding and  watch them go at each other\u2019s throats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/06b902e5325b4616a0b1f38965eaf2b3.poster.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/06b902e5325b4616a0b1f38965eaf2b3.webm?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/06b902e5325b4616a0b1f38965eaf2b3.mp4?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn, atmospheric visuals and haunting sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world brought to life with a unique mix of hand-drawn art, retro-futuristic digital interfaces and an ambient soundscape that deepens the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/a186a1c02ce6a3f28e6181680f4c394d.poster.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/a186a1c02ce6a3f28e6181680f4c394d.webm?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/a186a1c02ce6a3f28e6181680f4c394d.mp4?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who of the four other crew members to keep up with and which storylines to follow - several playthroughs are needed for the full picture. Heed the call of what lies beyond, and choose your legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PART OF AN EXTENDED UNIVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Fog Signals is a short, standalone experience that precedes the timeline of Misgiven, offering a dark perspective on events that shaped its universe 20 years prior. Find out what it's like to be a scientist in the depths of the crater of Koriol, exploring an uncharted ocean of toxic fog - discovering hidden horrors and wonders alike.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100900?t=1761902494","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/a04fc4630dd9c1c5267b8f1bdcd9b1d6838f2648/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761902494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/250c971a88af55adf5ed5be3bf760d9d510f1c06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761902494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/250c971a88af55adf5ed5be3bf760d9d510f1c06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761902494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game might feature mentions and depictions of violence, stylized gore, mental distress, body horror, murder and death. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrowflight Station - a remote research facility in the depths of a sea of fog, built in the shadow of a massive exoskeleton. Only five crew members remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/01d685dc87c43135c3bcb31eaa8729d6.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were supposed to be evacuated weeks ago. Now your sanity and your supplies are running out, as a violent fog storm has cut off any contact to the outside world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate a dwindling crew from a ramshackle comms room in order to survive, and choose what to prioritize in the face of complete disaster: your escape - or the scientific breakthrough you've been chasing your entire life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remote puzzle investigation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a radio operator. Gather clues and solve puzzles by interpreting research data and surveillance footage.  Get claustrophobic in the confines of a tiny comms room.</p><p class=\"