span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/06b902e5325b4616a0b1f38965eaf2b3.poster.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/06b902e5325b4616a0b1f38965eaf2b3.webm?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/06b902e5325b4616a0b1f38965eaf2b3.mp4?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn, atmospheric visuals and haunting sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world brought to life with a unique mix of hand-drawn art, retro-futuristic digital interfaces and an ambient soundscape that deepens the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/a186a1c02ce6a3f28e6181680f4c394d.poster.avif?t=1761902494\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/a186a1c02ce6a3f28e6181680f4c394d.webm?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/extras/a186a1c02ce6a3f28e6181680f4c394d.mp4?t=1761902494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who of the four other crew members to keep up with and which storylines to follow - several playthroughs are needed for the full picture. Heed the call of what lies beyond, and choose your legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PART OF AN EXTENDED UNIVERSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Fog Signals is a short, standalone experience that precedes the timeline of Misgiven, offering a dark perspective on events that shaped its universe 20 years prior. Find out what it's like to be a scientist in the depths of the crater of Koriol, exploring an uncharted ocean of toxic fog - discovering hidden horrors and wonders alike.</p>","developers":["Symmetry Break Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100900/18a818dba222e609e1c638dabcc837d80497f2d5/header.jpg?t=1761902494","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Symmetry Break Studio GmbH. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4100900/2098229321/f2031de5e5a63e17f791711b738c4394daf81161/1761579852/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761580303","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4100900/2098229321/f2031de5e5a63e17f791711b738c4394daf81161/1761579852/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761580303","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4100900/2098229321/f2031de5e5a63e17f791711b738c4394daf81161/1761579852/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761580303","id":257222539,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222539/movie480.mp4?t=1761580303","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222539/movie_max.mp4?t=1761580303"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222539/7c8fd288e192133325bedaf8c2e1283de3f9015c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761580303","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222539/movie480.webm?t=1761580303","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222539/movie_max.webm?t=1761580303"}}],"name":"Deep Fog Signals","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong